#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:2
msgid "Build and reuse JIT capabilities"
msgstr "构建并复用 JIT 能力"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:4
msgid "A conversation can need more than a fixed toolbox. ``JITHarnessExtension`` gives a trusted model a repository: a Python package in a directory on disk. The model writes tools and Markdown workflows into it with the file tools it already has, and the harness imports the package and registers what it finds. Because the repository is ordinary files, it survives the process, and the next session finds it again."
msgstr "对话有时需要的不止一个固定的工具箱。 ``JITHarnessExtension`` 为受信任的模型提供一个仓库（repository）：磁盘目录里的一个 Python 包。模型用自己已有的文件工具把工具和 Markdown 工作流写进去，harness 再导入这个包并注册其中的内容。由于仓库就是普通文件，它能在进程结束后继续存在，下一个会话还能找到它。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:11
msgid "JIT means building the tool environment when a task needs it, not a Python just-in-time compiler. This feature uses ordinary function calling on both Responses and Chat Completions, and it adds only three tools to the request."
msgstr "JIT 指的是在任务需要时才构建工具环境，而不是 Python 即时编译器。该功能在 Responses 和 Chat Completions 上都使用普通的函数调用，并且只会向请求中增加三个工具。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:17
msgid "Generated Python runs with your application's privileges. Imports and module-level statements execute when the model calls ``repo_load``, before any tool call. This is not a sandbox. Enable it only when trusted code execution is appropriate, and review a repository before loading one that came from elsewhere."
msgstr "生成的 Python 以你的应用的权限运行。模型调用 ``repo_load`` 时，导入语句和模块级语句就会执行，而且发生在任何工具调用之前。这不是沙箱。只有在执行受信任代码是合适场景时才启用它；加载来自其他地方的仓库之前，请先审查它。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:24
msgid "Enable a session-local repository"
msgstr "启用会话本地的仓库"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:26
msgid "Give the extension a directory that holds one subdirectory per session, and the model a way to write files there:"
msgstr "为扩展指定一个目录，其下每个会话对应一个子目录；再给模型一种往那里写文件的方式："

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:47
msgid "Run this inside an async function. ``model`` is a configured function-calling provider, ``add`` is your typed base tool, and ``write_file`` is any file tool that can reach the directory. The harness never writes source for the model: it can only run what the model, or your application, put on disk. The extension supplies current tool guidance, so an additional ``ToolGuidelinesExtension`` is not necessary. An explicit extension list replaces optional defaults; include history as above or use :doc:`session persistence <sessions>`."
msgstr "请在异步函数中运行这段代码。 ``model`` 是一个已配置好的、支持函数调用的模型提供商， ``add`` 是你定义的类型化基础工具， ``write_file`` 是任何能访问该目录的文件工具。harness 从不替模型写源码：它只能运行模型或你的应用放到磁盘上的内容。该扩展会提供当前的工具 guidelines，因此不需要再添加 ``ToolGuidelinesExtension``\\ 。显式给出的扩展列表会替换掉可选默认项；请像上面那样包含历史记录，或使用 :doc:`会话持久化 <sessions>`\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:55
msgid "Each session's repository lives in ``<root>/<session id>/<repo>/``. ``jit.session_directory(session_id)`` returns the session part. A conventional session id is the directory name; one with a path separator, a leading dot, or a very long id is turned into a readable stem plus a digest, so two sessions never share a directory and none can leave the root."
msgstr "每个会话的仓库位于 ``<root>/<session id>/<repo>/``\\ 。 ``jit.session_directory(session_id)`` 返回其中会话那一部分。常规的会话 ID 就是目录名；包含路径分隔符、以点开头或过长的 ID，会被转换成一段可读的前缀加摘要，因此两个会话永远不会共用一个目录，也没有哪个能跳出根目录。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:62
msgid "The model's three tools"
msgstr "模型的三个工具"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:68
msgid "Tool"
msgstr "工具"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:69
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行为"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:70
msgid "``repo_create(repo)``"
msgstr "``repo_create(repo)``"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:71
msgid "Create the session's repository, a package with an empty ``__init__.py``, and return its ``path``. Asking again returns the existing one."
msgstr "创建会话的仓库（一个带有空 ``__init__.py`` 的包），并返回它的 ``path``\\ 。再次调用会返回已有的那个。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:72
msgid "``repo_load()``"
msgstr "``repo_load()``"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:73
msgid "Import every module of the package and register every tool and workflow in it. Call it after each edit."
msgstr "导入包里的每个模块，并注册其中的每个工具和工作流。每次编辑之后都要调用。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:74
msgid "``repo_unload()``"
msgstr "``repo_unload()``"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:75
msgid "Hide every tool and workflow. The files stay on disk until the next ``repo_load``."
msgstr "隐藏所有工具和工作流。文件会保留在磁盘上，直到下一次 ``repo_load``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:77
msgid "All three use the runtime's serial scheduling mode and are reserved names. There is one repository per session: a second ``repo_create`` with another name is an error, so the model keeps everything it learns in one place. Each answers with the repository's name, absolute path, state (``created``, ``loaded`` or ``unloaded``), and the names it provides."
msgstr "这三个工具都使用运行时的串行调度模式，名称也都是保留的。每个会话只有一个仓库：用另一个名称再调用 ``repo_create`` 会报错，这样模型学到的一切都保存在同一个地方。每个工具都会返回仓库的名称、绝对路径、状态（ ``created``、 ``loaded`` 或 ``unloaded``）以及它提供的名称。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:84
msgid "Write a tool"
msgstr "编写工具"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:86
msgid "A tool is a top-level ``@tool`` function in any module of the package. A module can define several, helper modules are fine, and a tool imported from elsewhere is not registered:"
msgstr "工具就是包中任意模块里的顶层 ``@tool`` 函数。一个模块可以定义多个工具，辅助模块也没有问题，而从别处导入的工具不会被注册："

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:95
msgid "The tool contract is the same as :doc:`tools`: annotated arguments, a description, and non-empty guidelines. JIT tools are ordinary functions, not deferred or client-side search tools. Names are 1–64 letters, digits, underscores, or hyphens; they cannot repeat, shadow a base tool, or reuse a reserved name."
msgstr "工具契约与 :doc:`tools` 相同：带类型注解的参数、一段描述，以及非空的 guidelines。JIT 工具是普通函数，不是延迟加载的工具，也不是客户端搜索工具。名称由 1–64 个字母、数字、下划线或连字符组成；不能重复、不能遮蔽基础工具，也不能使用保留名称。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:101
msgid "``harness`` is already in every module's globals, so a module does not import it. It is deliberately not a builtin and not importable: only modules the harness loads see it. Split a large tool into modules and import siblings relatively (``from .steps import value``); a subdirectory needs an ``__init__.py`` to be a subpackage, and a plain directory is a namespace package. A repository holds at most 64 modules of 200,000 bytes each."
msgstr "``harness`` 已经在每个模块的全局变量里，所以模块无需导入它。它刻意不是内置名称，也不能被导入：只有 harness 加载的模块才看得到它。把大工具拆成多个模块，并用相对导入引用同级模块（ ``from .steps import value``）；子目录需要 ``__init__.py`` 才是子包，普通目录则是命名空间包。一个仓库最多包含 64 个模块，每个最大 200,000 字节。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:108
msgid "Loading imports the package under a throwaway name, so a repository called ``json`` cannot shadow the standard library. Nothing is cached as bytecode, so two quick edits of the same size are never served stale. The package stays imported while it is loaded, which means a tool may import a sibling lazily inside its body too."
msgstr "加载时会用一个一次性的名称导入这个包，因此名为 ``json`` 的仓库不会遮蔽标准库。不会缓存任何字节码，所以大小相同的两次快速编辑也不会读到过期内容。包在加载期间一直保持已导入状态，这意味着工具也可以在函数体里惰性导入同级模块。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:115
msgid "Reload after editing"
msgstr "编辑后重新加载"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:117
msgid "``repo_load`` imports the whole package afresh and replaces the previous version in one step, so an edit to any file takes effect together with every other. If anything fails, the previous version stays registered and the error names the file and line, relative to the repository:"
msgstr "``repo_load`` 会重新导入整个包，并一次性替换上一版本，因此对任何文件的编辑会与其他所有文件一起生效。只要有任何失败，上一版本就保持注册，错误信息会指出相对于仓库的文件和行号："

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:127
msgid "A failed load always raises ``ValueError``, whatever went wrong inside; the model reads the location and repairs the file with its own file tool. Module bodies and imports run on load, so their external side effects cannot be rolled back. Executions already started keep their original implementation; later calls use the new one. Reload also clears the unloaded state of the repository."
msgstr "无论内部出了什么问题，失败的加载总是抛出 ``ValueError``；模型读取位置信息，再用自己的文件工具修复文件。模块体和导入语句在加载时运行，所以它们的外部副作用无法回滚。已经开始的执行会保留它们原来的实现；之后的调用使用新实现。重新加载还会清除仓库的已卸载状态。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:134
msgid "Compose with the harness"
msgstr "通过 harness 组合"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:136
msgid "Use ``await harness.call_tool(name, **arguments)`` in async tools. For ordinary ``def`` functions, use the blocking composition entry point:"
msgstr "在异步工具中使用 ``await harness.call_tool(name, **arguments)``\\ 。对于普通的 ``def`` 函数，请使用阻塞式的组合入口："

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:146
msgid "Both paths check the current registration and execute parameter validation, middleware, and necessary tool hooks. Dependencies return Python values, not JSON strings, unless a result hook deliberately transforms them. Exceptions propagate to the outer tool unless your Python catches them. Only the outer call's result is recorded in the model conversation; no nested execution trace is emitted. A dependency that requests user input or approval still performs that interaction."
msgstr "两条路径都会检查当前的注册，并执行参数校验、中间件和必要的工具钩子。依赖返回的是 Python 值，而不是 JSON 字符串，除非某个结果钩子有意对它做了转换。除非你的 Python 代码捕获了异常，否则异常会向上传播到外层工具。只有外层调用的结果会记录到模型对话中；不会产生嵌套的执行轨迹。请求用户输入或审批的依赖仍然会执行那次交互。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:154
msgid "Synchronous code runs off the event loop. Do not call ``call_tool_sync`` from async code, or use it outside a running synchronous tool. Composition depth is bounded by ``max_call_depth`` (32 by default). Cancellation cannot forcibly stop arbitrary synchronous Python or undo side effects; give blocking I/O its own timeouts and avoid detached background work. While a module body runs, it cannot dispatch tools or change the harness."
msgstr "同步代码会在事件循环之外运行。不要在异步代码中调用 ``call_tool_sync``，也不要在没有正在运行的同步工具时调用它。组合深度受 ``max_call_depth`` 限制（默认 32）。取消无法强制停止任意的同步 Python 代码，也无法撤销副作用；请为阻塞式 I/O 单独设置超时，并避免游离在外的后台任务。模块体运行期间，它不能分发工具，也不能修改 harness。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:161
msgid "Composition inside a tool is programmatic tool calling: the model writes code that calls tools, instead of asking for one call per model turn. A single outer call can replace dozens of turns, nested results stay in Python and never reach the conversation, and every nested call still reaches profiling and events. Dependencies must be loaded, hooks and argument validation still apply, and the returned value should be JSON-friendly because it is what the model reads."
msgstr "工具内部的组合就是程序化工具调用：模型编写调用工具的代码，而不是每个模型回合只请求一次调用。一次外层调用可以替代几十个回合，嵌套的结果留在 Python 中，永远不会进入对话，而每次嵌套调用依然会进入性能分析和事件。依赖必须已加载，钩子和参数校验依然生效，返回值应当对 JSON 友好，因为它就是模型读到的内容。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:169
msgid "Save a workflow"
msgstr "保存工作流"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:171
msgid "When a task takes many exploratory steps, the guidance asks the model to consider keeping what worked. Choose a tool when the steps are fixed, and a workflow when the path still needs judgment. A workflow is a Markdown file, similar to a ``SKILL``, at ``workflows/<name>.md``:"
msgstr "当任务包含很多探索性步骤时，guidelines 会请模型考虑把有效的做法保留下来。步骤固定时选择工具；路径仍需要判断时选择工作流。工作流是 ``workflows/<name>.md`` 处的一个 Markdown 文件，类似于 ``SKILL``："

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:187
msgid "The front matter takes only ``description``, a hint of up to 512 characters. A loaded workflow is a reader tool named after the file, with ``offset=0`` and ``max_chars=2000``. Reading it returns a bounded page and never executes code or runs the workflow; the full body is not injected into each request, only the hint, the reader's schema, and its guidance. Follow a workflow only after checking that it applies and is safe: it cannot grant permissions or make an unloaded dependency available. A workflow and a tool cannot share a name."
msgstr "front matter 只接受 ``description``，也就是最多 512 个字符的提示。已加载的工作流是一个以文件名命名的读取器工具，参数为 ``offset=0`` 和 ``max_chars=2000``\\ 。读取它只会返回一个有界的页面，永远不会执行代码，也不会运行这个工作流；完整正文不会注入每次请求，只有提示、读取器的 schema 和它的 guidelines 会被提供。只有在确认工作流适用且安全之后才去遵循它：它不能授予权限，也不能让已卸载的依赖变得可用。工作流和工具不能重名。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:195
msgid "Validate a proposed optimization against representative tasks and account for the cost of creating and testing it. Guidance encourages this behavior; it does not guarantee that a model will learn, or that a saved path is globally optimal."
msgstr "请用有代表性的任务验证所提出的优化，并把创建和测试它的成本计算在内。guidelines 鼓励这种行为，但并不保证模型一定能学会，也不保证保存下来的路径全局最优。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:200
msgid "Resume a session"
msgstr "恢复会话"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:202
msgid "The files are the saved state. The harness keeps nothing else: there is no snapshot to write, and module globals, profiles, and recent errors are not saved. When a session's first request finds exactly one repository in its directory, the extension adopts it, loads it, and tells the model its name and path in the guidance, so a resumed session has its tools without asking. A repository that fails to load is still adopted, so ``repo_load`` can show the model the error. Several candidate directories are not guessed between."
msgstr "文件就是保存下来的状态。harness 不保留其他任何东西：没有快照可写，模块全局变量、性能分析和近期错误都不会被保存。当某个会话的首次请求在它的目录里恰好找到一个仓库时，扩展会接管并加载它，并在 guidelines 中告诉模型它的名称和路径，因此恢复的会话无需询问就拥有自己的工具。加载失败的仓库同样会被接管，这样 ``repo_load`` 就能把错误展示给模型。如果有多个候选目录，则不会去猜测选哪一个。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:210
msgid "Release an idle session with ``jit.forget_session(session_id)``. It removes the repository's modules and import hook from the interpreter and keeps the files. ``harness.close()`` does the same for a standalone harness. Back up, move, or delete a repository like any directory; deleting the session directory forgets what the model learned."
msgstr "用 ``jit.forget_session(session_id)`` 释放空闲的会话。它会把仓库的模块和导入钩子从解释器中移除，并保留文件。独立使用的 harness 用 ``harness.close()`` 完成同样的事。像对待任何目录一样备份、移动或删除仓库；删除会话目录就等于忘掉模型学到的内容。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:217
msgid "Choose whether to manage base tools"
msgstr "选择是否管理基础工具"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:219
msgid "``manage_base_tools=True`` (the default) lets the harness unload/reload and profile application-owned local tools, including tools supplied by extensions. Tools registered later during setup or replaced by a policy hook are adopted before model/tool dispatch. Synchronization does not restore tools removed by a policy."
msgstr "``manage_base_tools=True``\\ （默认值）允许 harness 卸载/重新加载并分析应用自有的本地工具，也包括由扩展提供的工具。在初始化过程中稍后注册的工具，或被某个策略钩子替换的工具，都会在模型/工具分发之前被接管。同步操作不会恢复被策略移除的工具。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:224
msgid "To protect the base toolbox and opt out of its profiling:"
msgstr "如果想保护基础工具箱，并选择不对它做性能分析："

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:231
msgid "In this mode base tools keep their normal request handlers, ``unload_tool`` and ``load_tool`` reject base names, and no base-call measurements or recent base errors are collected. Repository tools can still compose currently registered base tools, with validation, middleware, and hooks intact, and keep their own profiling. A parent tool's elapsed time still includes time spent in base dependencies. Calling an original application ``AgentTool`` directly bypasses the harness, so it cannot be counted or prevented by unloading a request registration."
msgstr "在这种模式下，基础工具保留它们正常的请求处理函数， ``unload_tool`` 和 ``load_tool`` 会拒绝基础工具的名称，也不会收集基础工具的调用测量数据或近期错误。仓库中的工具仍然可以组合当前已注册的基础工具，参数校验、中间件和钩子都保持有效，并保留各自的性能分析。父工具记录的耗时仍然包含花在基础依赖上的时间。直接调用原始的应用 ``AgentTool`` 会绕过 harness，因此无法被统计，也无法靠卸载请求注册来阻止。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:240
msgid "The Python API"
msgstr "Python API"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:242
msgid "``JITHarness`` is the same toolbox without the model: ``JITHarness(directory, tools=[...])`` with ``create_repo(name)``, ``load_repo()``, ``unload_repo()`` and ``close()``, plus ``repo`` and ``repo_path``. ``unload_tool(name)`` and ``load_tool(name)`` hide or restore one tool, base or repository, from your own code; the model has no tool for them. ``list_tools()`` and ``describe(name)`` read a compact catalog of names, origins, states, and descriptions. Measurements stay on their own methods: ``profile_stats(name)``, ``profile(name)``, and ``tool_errors(name)``."
msgstr "``JITHarness`` 就是没有模型参与的同一个工具箱： ``JITHarness(directory, tools=[...])``，提供 ``create_repo(name)``、 ``load_repo()``、 ``unload_repo()`` 和 ``close()``，以及 ``repo`` 和 ``repo_path``\\ 。 ``unload_tool(name)`` 和 ``load_tool(name)`` 让你从自己的代码里隐藏或恢复单个工具（基础工具或仓库工具）；模型没有对应的工具。 ``list_tools()`` 和 ``describe(name)`` 读取由名称、来源、状态和描述组成的紧凑目录。测量数据留在各自的方法上： ``profile_stats(name)``、 ``profile(name)`` 和 ``tool_errors(name)``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:264
msgid "Use profiling to build useful tools"
msgstr "借助性能分析构建有用的工具"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:266
msgid "Every harness records session-local measurements for base, repository, and management tools. Guidance asks the model to complete the user's task with minimal total token usage and end-to-end time, while preserving correctness, completeness, safety, and answer quality, and to count the costs of creating and testing a tool in that trade-off. The model does not read the measurements: they are for your application."
msgstr "每个 harness 都会为基础工具、仓库工具和管理工具记录会话本地的测量数据。guidelines 要求模型在保证正确性、完整性、安全性和回答质量的前提下，以尽可能少的总 token 用量和端到端时间完成用户的任务，并把创建和测试工具的成本也计入这一权衡。模型不会读取这些测量数据：它们是给你的应用用的。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:283
msgid "Aggregate statistics count finished calls per outcome plus mean duration and mean input and output characters. Each finished record carries its invocation id, tool name, origin, outcome, elapsed time, measured sizes, the composing caller when the call was nested, and an error type when it failed. Lifetime totals are not reset by a reload or unload. Look for repeated caller/dependency relationships a focused tool could compose, large outputs that can be reduced, and slow or failure-prone implementations. Profiling is evidence about execution, not a quality score."
msgstr "聚合统计按结果统计已完成的调用次数，并给出平均耗时以及平均输入和输出字符数。每条已完成的记录都带有它的调用 ID、工具名、来源、结果、耗时、测量到的长度，以及嵌套调用时的组合方调用者，失败时还带有错误类型。生命周期累计值不会因重新加载或卸载而重置。留意重复出现的调用方/依赖关系（专注的工具可以把它们组合起来）、可以缩减的大输出，以及缓慢或容易失败的实现。性能分析是关于执行的证据，而不是质量评分。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:292
msgid "Every record also carries a :class:`~zett_agent.jit_harness.enums.ToolOrigin`:"
msgstr "每条记录还带有一个 :class:`~zett_agent.jit_harness.enums.ToolOrigin`："

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:294
msgid "``base`` — an application-owned tool from ``tools=[...]`` or a tool-providing extension. It can be unloaded and profiled when base management is enabled."
msgstr "``base`` —— 来自 ``tools=[...]`` 的应用自有工具，或由某个提供工具的扩展提供。在启用基础工具管理时，它可以被卸载并接受性能分析。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:296
msgid "``python`` — a tool the model defined in its repository with ``@tool``. An unloaded tool keeps ``python``; its call status becomes ``rejected``."
msgstr "``python`` —— 模型在自己的仓库中用 ``@tool`` 定义的工具。已卸载的工具仍然保持 ``python``；它的调用状态会变成 ``rejected``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:298
msgid "``text`` — a workflow. Calls measure reading a page, not executing its steps."
msgstr "``text`` —— 一个工作流。调用测量的是读取某一页，而不是执行它的步骤。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:299
msgid "``management`` — ``repo_create``, ``repo_load``, or ``repo_unload``."
msgstr "``management`` —— ``repo_create``、 ``repo_load`` 或 ``repo_unload``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:300
msgid "``unknown`` — a defensive fallback for a name that was in no registry when the attempt was recorded. Normal dispatch does not produce it."
msgstr "``unknown`` —— 一种防御性兜底值，用于记录该次尝试时不在任何注册表中的名称。正常分发不会产生它。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:303
msgid "The ``status`` field is a :class:`~zett_agent.jit_harness.enums.ToolCallStatus`:"
msgstr "``status`` 字段是一个 :class:`~zett_agent.jit_harness.enums.ToolCallStatus`："

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:305
msgid "``completed`` — the handler returned. A later serialization or lifecycle-hook failure does not change the record, so ``completed`` means the tool itself ran."
msgstr "``completed`` —— 处理函数正常返回。之后出现的序列化或生命周期钩子失败不会改变该记录，因此 ``completed`` 表示工具本身已经运行过。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:307
msgid "``failed`` — the tool started and raised: argument validation, handler code, or an uncaught nested dependency error."
msgstr "``failed`` —— 工具已启动并抛出异常：可能是参数校验、处理函数代码，或未捕获的嵌套依赖错误。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:309
msgid "``cancelled`` — the awaiting caller was cancelled. A synchronous worker may still be running, because Python cannot forcibly stop it."
msgstr "``cancelled`` —— 等待的调用方被取消。同步工作线程可能仍在运行，因为 Python 无法强制停止它。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:311
msgid "``rejected`` — the harness refused the call before any handler body ran: the tool is unloaded, missing its base binding, no longer registered in the current request, or the nested call exceeded ``max_call_depth``."
msgstr "``rejected`` —— harness 在任何处理函数主体运行之前就拒绝了该调用：工具已卸载、缺少它的基础工具绑定、在当前请求中已不再注册，或者嵌套调用超过了 ``max_call_depth``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:315
msgid "Use these measurement rules when interpreting results:"
msgstr "解读结果时请遵循这些测量规则："

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:317
msgid "Input length is compact Unicode JSON, including property names and punctuation. Text output uses plain string length; structured output uses compact JSON. Multimodal output counts text blocks only, excluding image bytes and URLs. These are characters, not bytes, tokens, or exact provider payload sizes."
msgstr "输入长度按紧凑的 Unicode JSON 计算，包含属性名和标点。文本输出使用普通字符串长度；结构化输出使用紧凑 JSON。多模态输出只统计文本块，不含图像字节和 URL。这些数字是字符数，而不是字节数、token 数，也不是模型提供商载荷的精确大小。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:321
msgid "A missing measurement is ``None``, not zero. Character averages use measured samples only. Error output counts the error-message length; cancellation has no output measurement."
msgstr "缺失的测量值是 ``None``，而不是零。字符平均值只使用有测量数据的样本。错误输出统计的是错误消息的长度；取消没有输出测量值。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:324
msgid "Measurements stop at 8,000 characters, so a reported 8,000 means \"at least this many\"."
msgstr "测量在 8,000 个字符处截止，所以报告的 8,000 表示“至少这么多”。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:326
msgid "Duration is elapsed dispatch time, including validation, synchronous worker dispatch, and nested calls. Surrounding middleware, lifecycle hooks, and user approval waits are outside the boundary. A parent includes its children, so summing both double-counts nested work."
msgstr "耗时是分发过程的实际用时，其中包括校验、同步工作线程分发和嵌套调用。外层的中间件、生命周期钩子和用户审批等待都不在这个边界之内。父调用包含它的子调用，因此把两者相加会重复计算嵌套工作。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:330
msgid "A middleware short-circuit is not counted, because the tool never executed. Unknown names, stale request references, and rejected module-loading calls also create no record."
msgstr "中间件的短路不会被计入，因为工具从未执行。未知名称、失效的请求引用，以及被拒绝的模块加载调用也不会产生记录。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:334
msgid "The profile retains a bounded window of finished attempts in memory, not their input/output contents or exception messages: the newest ``call_capacity`` records (2,000 by default) survive, oldest dispatch first, while lifetime aggregates keep counting every attempt. Profiles survive later requests in the same in-memory harness but are not saved: a new process starts fresh. Export a page with ``report.model_dump_json()`` and read it back with ``JITHarnessProfile.model_validate_json(...)``."
msgstr "性能分析在内存中只保留一个有界的已完成尝试窗口，而不保留它们的输入/输出内容或异常消息：最新的 ``call_capacity`` 条记录（默认 2,000）会保留下来，最先被分发的先淘汰，同时生命周期聚合数据会继续统计每一次尝试。性能分析在同一个内存中的 harness 里能跨后续请求保留，但不会被保存：新进程会重新开始。用 ``report.model_dump_json()`` 导出一页，再用 ``JITHarnessProfile.model_validate_json(...)`` 读回来。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:343
msgid "Diagnose recent errors"
msgstr "诊断近期错误"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:345
msgid "Each session has a separate LRU cache of distinct errors, read by your application with ``harness.tool_errors``. The defaults retain 100 entries and at most 4,000 characters of each message:"
msgstr "每个会话都有一个独立的、用于存放不同错误的 LRU 缓存，由你的应用通过 ``harness.tool_errors`` 读取。默认保留 100 条条目，每条消息最多 4,000 个字符："

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:358
msgid "Both configuration values must be positive integers. Capacity is global to one harness, not a separate allowance for every tool. Errors deduplicate by tool name, exception type, and complete error message. A repeated error increments ``occurrences`` and moves that entry to the most recent position; when the cache is full, the least recently occurring entry is evicted. Reads do not refresh recency, and successful calls do not clear old evidence."
msgstr "这两个配置值都必须是正整数。容量对整个 harness 生效，而不是为每个工具单独分配。错误按工具名、异常类型和完整的错误消息去重。重复出现的错误会增加 ``occurrences``，并把该条目移到最近的位置；缓存满时，最近最少出现的条目会被淘汰。读取不会刷新新旧顺序，成功的调用也不会清除旧的证据。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:365
msgid "Records include the error type, bounded message, last occurrence time, count, and the latest invocation's caller and call ID. ``message_truncated`` indicates whether only a prefix was retained. ``occurrences`` covers the entry's current cache residence; lifetime failed/rejected counts remain available through profiling. An empty report is not proof that a tool never failed. Cancellations are recorded in profiling rather than the error cache. A failed ``repo_load`` is retained too. ``harness.tool_errors`` follows ``next_offset`` and takes ``limit`` from 1 to 1000, defaulting to 5."
msgstr "记录包括错误类型、有界的消息、最近一次发生的时间、次数，以及最近一次调用的组合方和调用 ID。 ``message_truncated`` 表示是否只保留了前缀。 ``occurrences`` 只覆盖该条目当前在缓存中停留期间；生命周期的失败/拒绝计数仍可通过性能分析获得。空报告并不能证明某个工具从未失败过。取消被记录在性能分析中，而不是错误缓存里。失败的 ``repo_load`` 同样会被保留。 ``harness.tool_errors`` 通过 ``next_offset`` 继续翻页， ``limit`` 取值 1 到 1000，默认 5。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:376
msgid "Exception messages may include sensitive application data. Arguments, tracebacks, and exception objects are not stored, but the error text itself is retained. Use applications and tools that redact secrets in their error messages."
msgstr "异常消息可能包含应用中的敏感数据。参数、回溯信息和异常对象不会被存储，但错误文本本身会被保留。请使用会在错误消息中抹去机密的应用程序和工具。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:382
msgid "Observe repository and tool calls"
msgstr "观察仓库和工具的调用"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:384
msgid "``JITHarnessExtension`` publishes two CUSTOM events so a UI or log can follow the harness as it works, including calls that never surface as ``TOOL_STARTED``:"
msgstr "``JITHarnessExtension`` 会发布两个 CUSTOM 事件，让 UI 或日志可以跟进 harness 的工作过程，其中包括那些从未以 ``TOOL_STARTED`` 形式出现过的调用："

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:391
msgid "Event name"
msgstr "事件名称"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:392
msgid "Emitted when"
msgstr "触发时机"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:393
msgid "``jit_tool_started``"
msgstr "``jit_tool_started``"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:394
msgid "A repository tool, workflow, or ``repo_*`` call is about to run."
msgstr "仓库中的某个工具、工作流或 ``repo_*`` 调用即将运行。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:395
msgid "``jit_tool_completed``"
msgstr "``jit_tool_completed``"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:396
msgid "That call returned or raised, adding ``success`` and ``error_type``."
msgstr "该调用返回或抛出异常时，会附带 ``success`` 和 ``error_type``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:398
msgid "Both events fire for calls the model requested and for calls one repository tool composes through ``harness.call_tool``, so a composed dependency is visible even though its result never reaches the conversation. Application base tools are skipped: the runtime already publishes ``TOOL_STARTED`` and ``TOOL_COMPLETED`` when the model requests them."
msgstr "无论是模型请求的调用，还是某个仓库工具通过 ``harness.call_tool`` 组合出的调用，都会触发这两个事件，因此即使组合出的依赖结果从未进入对话，它也是可见的。应用的基础工具会跳过：当模型请求它们时，运行时已经会发布 ``TOOL_STARTED`` 和 ``TOOL_COMPLETED``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:414
msgid "Each payload carries ``session_id``, ``tool_call_id``, ``tool_name``, and ``origin``; the completed event adds ``success`` and ``error_type``. The event stays small on purpose: arguments, results, and error messages are not copied into it. ``tool_call_id`` is the join key, matching both the conversation's ``ToolCall`` and the ``call_id`` of the record in :meth:`~zett_agent.jit_harness.runtime.JITHarness.profile`."
msgstr "每个 payload 都带有 ``session_id``、 ``tool_call_id``、 ``tool_name`` 和 ``origin``；完成事件还会增加 ``success`` 和 ``error_type``\\ 。事件刻意保持很小：参数、结果和错误消息都不会复制进去。 ``tool_call_id`` 是关联键，既对应对话中的 ``ToolCall``，也对应 :meth:`~zett_agent.jit_harness.runtime.JITHarness.profile` 中记录的 ``call_id``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:421
msgid "Events pair up for calls that reach dispatch. A call the harness rejects before running any handler emits no pair of its own; read ``profile()`` for its ``rejected`` record and ``tool_errors()`` for the message. Names this harness has never seen are ignored rather than reported as JIT calls."
msgstr "事件会为进入分发的调用成对出现。harness 在运行任何处理函数之前就拒绝的调用不会自己发出一对事件；请读取 ``profile()`` 获取它的 ``rejected`` 记录，读取 ``tool_errors()`` 获取相应消息。这个 harness 从未见过的名称会被忽略，而不会作为 JIT 调用上报。"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:427
msgid "Try the complete offline example"
msgstr "试用完整的离线示例"

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:429
msgid "The scripted model creates a repository, writes ``twice.py`` through a file tool, loads it, and invokes ``twice``. A second extension with the same root and session id then adopts the files and uses the tool again. The program also checks a synchronous → asynchronous → base-tool pipeline, empty inputs, a failed reload that keeps the previous version, dependency unload, a workflow, and a restart from the files alone. It uses a temporary directory and makes no network requests:"
msgstr "脚本化的模型会创建一个仓库，通过文件工具写入 ``twice.py``，加载它并调用 ``twice``\\ 。随后，使用相同根目录和会话 ID 的第二个扩展会接管这些文件，再次使用该工具。程序还会检查同步 → 异步 → 基础工具的流水线、空输入、保留上一版本的失败重新加载、依赖卸载、一个工作流，以及仅凭文件重启。它使用临时目录，不发起任何网络请求："

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:445
msgid "Expected output:"
msgstr "预期输出："

#: ../../learn/jit-harness.rst:454
msgid "Download :download:`the complete program <../_examples/jit_harness.py>`. For exact contracts, see :class:`~zett_agent.jit_harness.runtime.JITHarness` and :class:`~zett_agent.jit_harness.extension.JITHarnessExtension`."
msgstr "下载 :download:`完整程序 <../_examples/jit_harness.py>`\\ 。若需精确的契约，请参阅 :class:`~zett_agent.jit_harness.runtime.JITHarness` 和 :class:`~zett_agent.jit_harness.extension.JITHarnessExtension`\\ 。"

